      "statement": "The ordinary threshold defaults to 80% of the machine (CELLD_MAX_RSS_MB) and applies to the greater of allocator-adjusted RSS and the allocator-adjusted cgroup working set; the absolute cap is a fixed 95% of the machine never derived from the threshold (125% of an explicit threshold when machine size is unknown), applies to the complete cgroup charge, and a threshold at or above the cap makes the cap the effective limit, which the node reports at startup.",
