      "statement": "Under pressure celld sheds LRU idle cells by durably replicating and fencing them, publishing them unowned without resetting epochs, and refusing to reacquire unowned cells; cells with active work or live host WebSockets are never shed and each limit releases separately at 80% of its value.",
