      "statement": "SIGTERM/SIGINT and POST /shutdown start the same graceful path: health reports unhealthy, new public requests get 503, in-flight requests finish, versioned peer traffic continues for un-handed-off cells, and handoff=preserve switches to a same-node reload that keeps ownership records.",
