      "statement": "Shutdown handoff is batched through the core's drain pump: draining is sticky, at most CELLD_RELEASES (8) handoffs are in flight, quiescing cells queue new requests for the successor while admitted work finishes, and each handoff covers activity cancellation, durability proof, final snapshot, ownership release, and successor adoption.",
