      "id": "claim_538cf7356bf74a8a98976bce43e38bf5",
      "statement": "A draining node claims a fleet drain token (one bucket object) before releasing cells so concurrent donors hand off one node at a time; the wait is bounded (CELLD_DRAIN_TOKEN_WAIT_MS, default 30000, 0 disables), the token is advisory and dead-holder claims expire, and a fresh node treats a live foreign claim as an unsettled fleet.",
